`lastName` is inherited from `Person` (accessed via `getLastName()`).

### Request DTO — `OwnerFieldsDto` (generated from OpenAPI schema `OwnerFields`)
Defined in `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/resources/openapi.yml` (lines 1991-2051). No hand-written source file exists; it is generated. Schema:

```yaml
OwnerFields:
  title: Owner fields
  description: Editable fields of a pet owner.
  type: object
  properties:
    firstName:  { type: string, minLength: 1, maxLength: 30, pattern: "^[\\p{L}]+([ '-][\\p{L}]+){0,2}$", example: George }
    lastName:   { type: string, minLength: 1, maxLength: 30, pattern: "^[\\p{L}]+([ '-][\\p{L}]+){0,2}\\.?$", example: Franklin }
    address:    { type: string, minLength: 1, maxLength: 255, example: '110 W. Liberty St.' }
    city:       { type: string, minLength: 1, maxLength: 80, example: Madison }
    telephone:  { type: string, minLength: 1, maxLength: 20, pattern: '^[0-9]*$', example: '6085551023' }
